  "releaseNotes": "Bump SkiaSharp from 3.119.4 to 4.148.0\n\n**Dependency and Target Framework Updates:**\n\n* The main project (`SkiaSharpCompare`) now targets only `net10.0`, [dropping support for `net8.0` and `net9.0`](https://codeuctivity.github.io/blog/commercial-support#2-ongoing-support-for-specific-environmentsversions).\n* Upgraded `SkiaSharp`, `SkiaSharp.NativeAssets.Linux.NoDependencies`, and `SonarAnalyzer.CSharp` to their latest versions in both the main and test projects. [[1]](diffhunk://#diff-cc092e15adbb7d9e6a59430c3b283e6947bcd56f5b8519942f6393c73ab5e604L48-R50) [[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0ede8fc81923be26702694e56b79ddcade373aea98c36347c432bf8d66466aa5L16-R24)",
